      <div class="bf-wrap">
        <p class="bf-eyebrow">WHAT I WRITE</p>
        <h2 class="bf-heading" id="bf-formats-title">Content for the moment <em>a buyer is choosing.</em></h2>
        <p class="bf-intro">
          The right asset depends on what the buyer is trying to decide. These are the formats I use to help prospects understand your product, assess its fit and make a more informed choice.
        </p>

        <div class="bf-formats-grid">
          <article class="bf-format-card">
            <div class="bf-format-top"><span>01</span><span>COMPARE</span></div>
            <h3>Product comparison pages</h3>
            <p>Explain the meaningful differences between your product and another option, using buyer-relevant criteria and verifiable product details.</p>
            <span class="bf-format-foot">X vs Y / Head-to-head</span>
          </article>
          <article class="bf-format-card">
            <div class="bf-format-top"><span>02</span><span>RECONSIDER</span></div>
            <h3>Alternatives pages</h3>
