            <span class="bf-format-foot">Alternatives / Competitors</span>
          </article>
          <article class="bf-format-card">
            <div class="bf-format-top"><span>03</span><span>UNDERSTAND</span></div>
            <h3>Product and use-case content</h3>
            <p>Connect product capabilities to specific problems, jobs and workflows instead of simply repeating feature descriptions.</p>
            <span class="bf-format-foot">Use cases / Product-led explainers</span>
          </article>
          <article class="bf-format-card">
            <div class="bf-format-top"><span>04</span><span>EVALUATE</span></div>
            <h3>Buyer's and evaluation guides</h3>
            <p>Give prospects a practical framework for assessing options, requirements, trade-offs and product fit.</p>
            <span class="bf-format-foot">Buyer guides / Evaluation</span>
          </article>
          <article class="bf-format-card">
            <div class="bf-format-top"><span>05</span><span>VERIFY</span></div>
            <h3>Customer case studies</h3>
            <p>Turn real customer experience into specific evidence of the problem, implementation, product use and outcome.</p>
            <span class="bf-format-foot">Customer evidence / Outcomes</span>
          </article>
          <article class="bf-format-card">
            <div class="bf-format-top"><span>06</span><span>BUILD TRUST</span></div>
            <h3>Founder and product thought leadership</h3>
            <p>Develop useful points of view grounded in product knowledge, customer understanding and the market you operate in.</p>
            <span class="bf-format-foot">Founder voice / Market perspective</span>
          </article>
        </div>
