    <!-- 09 / FAQs -->
    <section class="bf-section bf-faq" aria-labelledby="bf-faq-title">
      <div class="bf-wrap bf-faq-layout">
        <div>
          <p class="bf-eyebrow">A FEW THINGS YOU MAY BE WONDERING</p>
          <h2 class="bf-heading" id="bf-faq-title">Before we <em>get into it.</em></h2>
          <p class="bf-intro">A few practical questions about the work, the research and what it takes to get started.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bf-faq-list">
          <details class="bf-faq-item">
            <summary>What does a BOFU content writer do for a B2B SaaS company?</summary>
            <div class="bf-faq-answer"><p>A BOFU content writer creates content for buyers who are evaluating specific products and deciding which solution to choose. This can include comparison pages, alternatives pages, product and use-case content, buyer guides and case studies.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="bf-faq-item">
            <summary>How is BOFU content different from regular SaaS blog writing?</summary>
            <div class="bf-faq-answer"><p>It is built around a different reader need. A broad educational article may help someone understand a problem or category. BOFU content helps someone assess a product, compare it with other options, verify claims and decide whether it fits.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="bf-faq-item">
            <summary>How will you understand my product before writing?</summary>
            <div class="bf-faq-answer"><p>I review product documentation, workflows, use cases and existing positioning, then speak with you or relevant product experts to verify how it works, who it serves and what makes it meaningfully different.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="bf-faq-item">
            <summary>Can you help if my ICP or positioning is not fully developed?</summary>
            <div class="bf-faq-answer"><p>Yes. A finished ICP and perfectly polished positioning are not prerequisites. We can review and refine the available information, but the work needs a live product, an identifiable audience, useful product or customer knowledge and access to people who can verify claims.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="bf-faq-item">
            <summary>What do you need from me to get started?</summary>
            <div class="bf-faq-answer"><p>Access to the product or a walkthrough, relevant documentation, what you know about your customers and competitors, and time with someone who can answer product questions. We will also agree on the buyer, the content's purpose and the next action it should support.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="bf-faq-item">
            <summary>Do you guarantee Google rankings, AI citations or demos?</summary>
            <div class="bf-faq-answer"><p>No. Content can be researched and structured to serve relevant search intent and make product information clearer to search engines and AI systems, but rankings, citations, recommendations, demos and revenue cannot be guaranteed.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="bf-faq-item">
            <summary>Should I start with a content project or a BOFU content system?</summary>
            <div class="bf-faq-answer"><p>A content project is suited to a defined asset or related batch. A BOFU content system is suited to a broader programme covering buyer and product research, positioning refinement, opportunity mapping, planning, execution, distribution and improvement.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="bf-faq-item">
            <summary>How much does BOFU content writing cost?</summary>
            <div class="bf-faq-answer"><p>Pricing depends on the asset, research requirements, product complexity and whether the work is a single project or a broader system. We agree the scope, deliverables and fee before work begins.</p></div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
